# Local Kiro session state — never shared, resets per branch
.kiro/current-ticket.json

# A ticket typed at the terminal (pre-commit's manual-entry fallback, or
# post-commit's ticket-switch prompt) that couldn't be validated against
# Jira at the git-hook level (no credential there) — Kiro chat's
# ask-ticket hook checks it for real via atlassian-rovo MCP on the next
# message, then deletes this file. See TODO.md, 2026-08-27.
.kiro/pending-ticket-check.json

# Sonar scan scratch output
/tmp/sonar-scan.log

# .kiro-tracking/ — hook diagnostic log plus one debug-convenience JSON
# file per ticket (overwritten every commit, never accumulated). Neither
# is the tracking data anymore: as of 2026-08-27 the real record is each
# commit's own Kiro-* trailers (see .githooks/commit-msg), which
# scripts/calculate-pr-credits.sh reads from git history directly.
# Previously this held one *committed* JSON file per commit forever —
# removed after confirming (grep) nothing but commit-msg ever read them.
# See TODO.md and docs/runbook.md.
.kiro-tracking/

# OS / editor noise
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Local Claude Code settings — machine-specific, not project config
.claude/
